{"id":"86bc7b5f63062534","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-lusin.md","title":"Lusin Theorem","display":"df-lusin — Lusin Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lusin","aliases":["58-df-lusin","Lusin Theorem"],"display":"df-lusin — Lusin Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lusin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lusin</span><span>Lusin Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lusin — Lusin Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md\">../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,f\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md\">../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (binary form, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RadonMeasure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{LusinProperty}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RadonMeasure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{LusinProperty}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 为所引通常实拓扑定义的唯一值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> 使用书内 Borel 定义。定理另要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span>；不将此条件加入四元 RadonMeasure 定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}radon} \\vdash \\mathrm{RadonMeasure}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_X)\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_X\\})\\to K\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(K)&lt;\\infty\\right)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mu(A)=\\sup\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land K\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_X\\})\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}radon} \\vdash \\mathrm{RadonMeasure}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_X)\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_X\\})\\to K\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(K)&lt;\\infty\\right)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mu(A)=\\sup\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land K\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_X\\})\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{LusinProperty}_S(f,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow E\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(E)&lt;\\infty\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists K\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(K\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_X\\})\\land\\mu(E\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(f\\upharpoonright K,K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_X\\},\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{LusinProperty}_S(f,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow E\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(E)&lt;\\infty\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists K\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(K\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_X\\})\\land\\mu(E\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(f\\upharpoonright K,K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_X\\},\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{RadonMeasure}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F)\\land E\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(E)&lt;\\infty\\to\\mathrm{LusinProperty}_S(f,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{RadonMeasure}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F)\\land E\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(E)&lt;\\infty\\to\\mathrm{LusinProperty}_S(f,E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lusin: under the displayed Radon and finite-measure hypotheses, measurable functions are continuous on a large compact subset.</li>\n<li>Measurable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> continuous (arbitrarily large compact set of restriction)</li>\n<li>A Tietze extension additionally requires an appropriate normal ambient space; it is not part of Lusin's theorem.</li>\n<li>Approximation: simple functions approximate measurable</li>\n<li>Each compact subset carries the topology induced from the displayed ambient topology inline; the former free symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_K\">\\(\\tau_K\\)</span> no longer changed meaning as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> varied under a quantifier.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Natanson, Theory of Functions of a Real Variable</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"69f8a4b0afb36176","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2e63b755a37f1dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","ex